<title>USA: May to open 13 stores in 1997.</title>
<headline>May to open 13 stores in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>May Department Stores Co said Tuesday it plans to open 13 new stores in 1997, adding two million square feet of retail space.</p>
<p>In 1996, it opened 28 department stores, 13 of which were acquired, bringing it to a total of 365 stores at the end of fiscal 1996.</p>
